    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、何ズラ？
お前たち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What Is It?
You guys...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おわっ！
本当にしゃべった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! It really talks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すげぇ！お前、すげぇ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's crazy! Dude, you're awesome!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やぶからぼうに何ズラか……？
オレ様は今ブロウクンハート中だから、
あっち行ってて欲しいズラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What Are You Talking About? I currently
have a Broken Heart, so please just go
away and leave me alone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ブロウクン……？
さっきもめてたことかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Broken...? Oh, because of what
you were arguing about before?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、見てたズラか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, Did You See That?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいんズラ、どうせオレ様なんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's Fine. After all, I'm just...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よくないよ。
ぜんぜんよくない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not fine. It's not fine at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>困ってる人がいたら、
ほっとけないもん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If someone's struggling, we
can't just leave them alone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人……？
オレ様を人だと見てくれるズラ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Someone...? You're willing
to see me as a person?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっきの団員に
非可動フィギュアだと
馬鹿にされたオレ様をズラか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even Though Your Party
Member There just ridiculed
me as an inanimate figurine?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（……非可動じゃないけど、
実際人間じゃないし、
フィギュアっぽいけどな……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(...I mean, it's not inanimate, but it's
pretty obvious it's not a real person...
It just looks like a figurine to me...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん！　だから元気出して！
わたしたちが力になって
あげる！　ね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah! So cheer up!
And we'll help you
out, too! Okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おお……おお……
ヒーリングハート！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh... Oooh...
Healing Heart!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかったズラ！
包み隠さず話すズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Understand! I'll
tell you everything!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレ様はタルロウXズラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Am Tarlow X.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とある変態技術士の
ところから飛び出して、
この遊園地にやってきたズラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Escaped From A Certain
Weirdo Engineer's place, and
came to this amusement park.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>家出……なの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're...a runaway?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かにそうとも言うズラ。
でもあのままあすこにいたら、
戦闘用ロボに改造されていたズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You Could Put It That Way. But if
I stayed in that place, I would have
been made into a combat robot!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレ様はそんなの嫌ズラ！
人々に夢を与える職業に
就きたいズラよ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Would Hate That! I wish to
take up work bestowing dreams
upon the people of the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つまり、
夢を与える仕事がしたくて、
飛び出したのね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So basically, you wanted
to bestow dreams upon
people, so you fled?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのとおりズラ！
で、選んだのが
ここの劇団だったんズラが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's Exactly It! And so,
I decided to work for the
theatre troupe here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あー、さっき落とされたのか。
入団テスト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, so you failed the interview.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいんだズラ。
そのとおりズラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's Fine.
He's correct.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>旧８ビットマシンのように
１方向しか向けないオレ様には
劇は無理だ、と落とされたズラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Am Originally An 8-Bit Machine, and can only
face one direction. They said I cannot work in
the theatre like that, and so they rejected me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え！　そうなのか！？
会話のときとか、どうすんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh! Really!? So wait, when
you wanna talk to someone,
like, what do you do?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この体の駆動音で
相手に存在を認識させるズラよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Use My Body's Engine Sounds to
draw their attention to my existence.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ある意味すげぇ！
プレミア！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's kinda awesome!
Like, premium vibes!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう！　&lt;Dio&gt;だまってて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, &lt;Dio&gt;, just
shut up already!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……で、方向転換できるように
なりたいの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So, do you want to learn
how to turn your body?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いや、それはいろいろな事情で
無理なんだズラ。
だから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No, There Are Many
Reasons why that would
not be effective. So...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だから？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>踊れるようになりたいズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Want To Learn To Dance!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>１方向しか向けないオレ様でも、
こんなに踊れます、表現できます
ってところを見せたいんだズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I Want To Show Them I Can
Express Myself through dance,
even if I cannot turn my body!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>表現かぁ……
うん！　わかったよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Express yourself, hm...
Okay! I understand!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当ズラか！？
な、何とかしてくれるズラか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? Y-You'll do something
to help me!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私たちが直接ダンスを教えることは
無理だから、それができそうな人を
連れてきてあげる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can't teach you to dance ourselves,
so we'll find someone who should be
able to, and bring them here!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おお！　おお！
グレートハート！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh! Oooh!
Great Heart!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うーん、そんなアテ
あったか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Huhh... Did we know
anyone like that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、人が集まるところ、
レストランなんか探してみようよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, first, we'll just go look
somewhere with a lot of people.
Like a restaurant, maybe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>探してくるまで少しの間、
待っててくれる？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can you wait for a little
bit while we look for you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろんズラ！
頼んだズラ！
ずーっと待ってるズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Of Course! I'm counting on you!
I'll wait as long as you need!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（……それはそうと
さっきの『いろいろな事情』が
気になる……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(...You know, I kinda
wanna know more about
those "many reasons"...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（どうせ明かされねんだろうし、
気にしないどくか……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(But he's probably not gonna
tell us, so maybe I'll let it go...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
